5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited for our trip! I want to go somewhere really adventurous this year. Where should we go? Let's figure out the best place quickly!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Slow down, Rin. Excitement is fine, but we need a plan that actually works. Let's look at the logistics first so we don't waste the whole trip just getting there.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Shunichi. We need a logical approach to avoid unnecessary stress. Before we decide on a destination, we should examine the costs and logistics to ensure the plan is sustainable for everyone.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Stop worrying so much about the ""logistics"" and just pick something cool! But fine, if we have to be boring, let's just get the facts and decide. I'm ready whenever you guys are.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,It is better to be thorough now than to regret it later. Let's use the list to gather the necessary data before we commit to a specific location.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know exactly how much everything costs from the start! I'll look into ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" and ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole."" That way, there are no surprises!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're already talking about efficiency, I'll handle the travel side. I'm looking into ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus."" Let's see if we can actually minimize the transit waste.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"To ensure we have a fair and transparent financial structure, I will look into ""What separately booked rooms cost last time"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately."" We need a clear baseline for expenses.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not into the money stuff. I want to know how we're actually living. I'll check ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements."" Let's make sure it's not a nightmare.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran."" I believe understanding our past patterns is essential for a successful trip this year.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, @Asuka, @Takumi, @Toshio, we've all picked our things! I can't wait to see what we find. I hope we find a place that's super fun and doesn't cost a million dollars!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka"",""Takumi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, your optimism is exhausting. Let's just wait for the data. Once we see the travel times and costs, the ""fun"" part will be much easier to manage without it becoming a disaster.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, I agree. Data is the only way to avoid ambiguity. Once we have the figures, we can establish a clear payment structure so that no one is unfairly burdened by the costs.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, you're talking like a textbook again. Who cares about ""payment structures""? I just want to make sure we aren't crammed into some tiny room with a weird schedule. Let's just get this over with.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, comfort is important, but the atmosphere is what truly defines the experience. Let us see what the data reveals and then we can decide on a destination that suits everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm just so ready! Let's get the answers and pick the coolest place ever! I'll be waiting for the results with my fingers crossed for something amazing!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'm already over the anticipation. Let's just get the information and move to the decision phase. I'll be waiting to see if the travel options are actually reasonable this year.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am also ready to move forward. Once the information is available, we can analyze it objectively to ensure the final choice is both practical and equitable for everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Whatever. Just make sure the place isn't some dump with a strict curfew. I'm done talking for now.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us wait for the results. I will analyze the patterns from our previous trips to ensure we find a balance that works for all of us this time.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
